# Public family d59b0160

The 4×4 color-3 L-key contains three marker colors.  Every separate non-gray
rectangular panel whose marker payload contains all three key colors is erased
to gray; incomplete panels survive unchanged.

The alternative `highlight_closest_survivor` first performs that filter, then
derives the positive missing-key count of every survivor and recolors the
minimum class's marker payload to 9.  The source-bound counterfactual selects
before filtering and therefore chooses a complete panel that stage A deletes.
Generated lessons support 2–6 demonstrations, exactly four matched-input
queries, and an exact 30×30 final query.  Owner registration and qualification
remain pending; no training admission is claimed.
